<title>UK: Boots shares up as BZW upgrades to &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Boots shares up as BZW upgrades to &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Boots Co Plc rose to a record high on Friday after analysts at BZW raised the stock to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; and the price was squeezed higher by a shortage of stock in the market, dealers said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 15-1/2p at 678-1/2 by 1124 GMT in volume of 2.2 million shares. Earlier it reached an all-time peak of 680p, surpassing the previous high of 667p set yesterday.</p>
<p>Analysts at BZW declined comment on the move.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
